{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1435,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20d6b24e9b3feeb4e1ea27df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该展现实力了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c4368408b94cc9e1764cf3cd49c06dbc03af6847cbb66a35aacacd58017a540",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c2c97d67a4b15d9d8012f3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对我而言，有你就好。这份心情至今\r\n未曾改变。……此后，\r\n也绝不会改变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58d52c291c682a42ba6e70df80f5e80a73a9dccb7845de82372fcff9e503d77c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c5a191246a57430cbc83ac0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68c0e639b27d38636d4d3166",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51fe82f1af722443a900d66f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "纵使前路艰险，\r\n只要有你这位同志在侧——\r\n那是何等的令人心安啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b5f348b4b37e69194978360a7fe16f21f7ca0e6342dd9e8071680cbcd4d4d74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32cb4db31e9fdd1b94e18289",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你不仅对于船桥，对我而言也是\n无可替代、至关重要的人……。\n无论多少次，我都会亲口告诉你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ddadfb7af7a8f5d5d036fdd30b3de2ad0851811df113a306821bcbab900fb8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a1b1bded47d86777a46a3a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让整个赛界都染上船桥的色彩……\n这就是我们新年的抱负。\n我们两人，定要合力达成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4598a802765678efe0190435ab0e0036a182800a003171625d0e77d6e2572879",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a73f6c962a5f9fd4c778621",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是给您的谢礼巧克力——哈！\r\n您该不会已经收过中央那些孩子的了吧？\r\n请千万不要被她们勾走心魂哦？？",
      "source_fingerprint": "57297c6285257044ea8353044425fbff9cfd81d1715c35e94db414f6d19b8f1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a260967e010cdb4b584baa0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "味道虽然普通……但巧克力中寄托的\n这份信赖与感谢，我是绝不会输给\n任何人的。……绝对不会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ded4fe6326e7d3f40586824631c9e0fd6c6a57708f8eff8f74b4a9b8a65693b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94922b6554b0a9c337984f91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "纸笺上的愿望似乎和我的一样呢。\r\n……既然如此，不如写上联名吧？\r\n这样感觉更容易实现呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccbbaae0aa520561bed4139a391270b04fcffea96141cd736e0da49135346338",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5c24bb68ca339cd76b2e2f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "糖果的准备已经万无一失了。中央那些\r\n“不给糖就捣蛋”之类的花招，\r\n我都会一一化解给您看的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6d5a40c924ebdc7cca8fdb91fb7a63475bb6478befb4c28d994b73fcf05e391",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f414ac2565763dde7a5e229f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去逛圣诞集市的时候，父亲和母亲的\r\n钱包似乎就会管不住……\r\n我必须得替他们好好管理才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a437371b33d0357f21471d4699803dc12af40c27ee8af07796cec18f1fab6dc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c814fcb9c4a536cb09a4806",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说圣诞会的准备工作，在我们要\r\n抵达的时候就能结束了哦。\r\n来吧来吧，我们出发，回船桥去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c892e801e082567508837fed58e0a0d33fa12329764256d80820bec1e7e6758",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d7b9a04467d38b8a2c5d2db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d451f46b33a02f60d5453e3ae20916e2eb376a38136de5b6217d57d44af927d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb4792d418bffb6a9ae465d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "年末的伴手礼要选什么好呢？\r\n离回去的电车发车还有时间，\r\n我们多逛几家店吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f317c58d8a600efc82288508a7d34bef5b8b5446fad651c3f54e600c5f769ba1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79af68b34cf26a3616438c82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝您生日快乐。\r\n作为志同道合之人，请允许我献上\r\n祝词——……啊，太死板了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d5eb7b3ff9b16cfe51d6ceca9f6e62f0e9164bf36bdf1d72b2c2dd4926c0dad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6744cce8b51e0941343c62fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回头我会送您一条庆祝生日的手帕。\r\n因为我本人也在用，使用感绝对有\r\n保证。那可是名副其实的船桥第一。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4546ab225dfaf832ca7ce746882ff7dbc215400367f4c4d8072029f23939017",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4e44c14eea751e685db1852",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的生日，您一直帮我\r\n记着呢……这份船桥名点\r\n大礼包，我会心怀感激地享用的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e36f63faebe3a9456135d4b9e72f9ffa7f8c77b9cbcfa871f8f68f75ea40fc96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b0179fab01f0c17cc59e989",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日想要的东西，是吗？\r\n那么……我想去兜风。\r\n想和同志一起，巡视我深爱的故乡。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5bb5ba2dbec9f2dbd57bdf7a8787c5e88ef82264d1458808cdbdd65c0287beb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59260da2bfd8eea0096c60b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到通知了呢。\r\n为了不失礼数，\r\n请务必仔细阅读。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fbee594b38a05ba06eed97cc89c1841b73f3219f11fdda376169a39e6adc625",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcd4fbba0725ad31ef43cfe8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有礼物寄到了哦。\r\n我这边也有……是从船桥寄来的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48b0fb5f512f128d184e39a663eb38bed37048105c1e1072f95e26e15312c716",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63d586fd5a3c9e8b47f59a51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务达成。\r\n看来连中央也认可了这份功绩呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ceab6207f81ef34aca966826326a6cfe4be92c1710553708126c1f210319f31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd6cb05e6de8320a84494183",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动快要开始了吗？\r\n中央的庆典究竟有何等规模……\r\n我必须亲眼确认一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ab49b858de137baf5a06771ff460bc2047c7c1d67b37828b9e578a0b50e33ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f95967d152c33cf1def7f817",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动正在举办中呢。\r\n待会儿我们去侦察一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2ebbd1b35209e3a7dfa73daab61c1b23c41421db3879f48e28806bd0419cb58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6a77385cd527dd35e09561c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是不争气……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a5d15d2948e9e163c4abf34e7d3aa43bc2ee1ce2e883455d566c215fe71f96e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbe2773ca9233cb8ca20f469",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级提升了……\r\n该用日式点心来庆祝呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "808da0be2d0bbccb1583621a3175097bb1e43893c3abd7358fa7cfc2d1d8c250",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c275f106d1f359e045bbd4eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "关于时尚，说实话我并不太懂……。\r\n考虑到要去海滩，功能性强、\r\n方便活动的衣服才是首选吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8081d47499ad75f2f5775e89271e4d058d67a037e8643a28377f075e05b60cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0631f8de65a2776ba87911d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前，每次弄得满身是沙回家，\r\n都会被家里人苦笑迎接。当然\r\n现在的话……顶多只会粘上一点点啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58f9c838c1e0e4b65cef454b2b02706aba5f42113eaba059e2991cb9f40afb53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9321c72b1ac048516d9ffbdd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妹妹似乎正在为升学的事情烦恼，\r\n却固执地一直说着『没问题』……\r\n明明可以多依赖我一下的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef086379ac5ee293fe281e657e1d307109eb7a06492913974819e65d5f119429",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a42ee4088e92cb255d3c679",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对手也相当了得……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33bdb322ff12300fa95e5297cee84997fe671cfb20f179072cd392b3b768a0bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8af2d2bece4abf18715bc3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是理所应当的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1768d374b56b269e239f18e45566cd0112aa08c6ae7bbcd5d928405723d6670b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b4c5b97e95f8e2a6bcf07c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是不争气……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a5d15d2948e9e163c4abf34e7d3aa43bc2ee1ce2e883455d566c215fe71f96e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ab57204d3a122fd15bdf57e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对手也相当了得……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33bdb322ff12300fa95e5297cee84997fe671cfb20f179072cd392b3b768a0bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f1f091354407137d53ddb08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刷新纪录了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbd54b5d65ed7ad95de265a239cd7e0357feca6ed137778f4af2090df7519eb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d963c5852fc3519916c77362",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b52ec6a51ea86f04e77eb47b539df83710d70ffb623152a29d619d493402def",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec2e333d416b39f54ab43d40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c4e15556edacd3aa6f9822d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是要训练吗？\r\n我等候多时了。\r\n随时可以开始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd4a7566133cb840f50587927b74553e243297f3ae320944e233f1814b0d544d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ee3500c9300a40ff0551cb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "中央的历史底蕴深厚……但是，\r\n船桥也绝不逊色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9183868fac4955925b20e6fc60259ec36ade021008f84f510155139cef0732c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5563036ec85066a544631d5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要报名参赛的话，随时都可以。\r\n展现我们的力量吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec96e3ec650e86a7adbc8b49c7449165b04216dc3ac49589adcb9b971e528215",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85cd896356d958625bd1bea4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3040bca4f512d7ea10e7848c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将这份炽热的情感化作力量……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d23cefe53979bc3896742ae1eba889fd53e639f53bb5d996abffe54f3b508d4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b255f87cf2e28ebc202ed706",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来决胜负吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e60617f804ed0ea5828e5dfc062db3318c92cb200b76702a6b88426d8087558",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "1221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6f8d6f2a319422ac4c6a4d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了故乡。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7628552271cdc4e939037f5850112ba6f5aa8437e59d0360c98a2b946dcbf20d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "1222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a4d204b66f67e8a55126f98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不许小看我……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b0bf4285888ee3a7359927738776963fddc73ea0f49483873996b19c7cac314",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "1243"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ecfc77f1b8f94a8d6075761",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是您的登录奖励。\r\n请收下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a447735448722757fdba7eec87d91247555aebe4a8b35b12bf19e525d03c360",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c95c014201ce5f70ced4f6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "慎重地，瞄准目标吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "345ca5479c1c8510613a23beb2baff3c5a3aa5943131d7c73742c1858d7d1579",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8859dc9430ce675bc22dcab9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d451f46b33a02f60d5453e3ae20916e2eb376a38136de5b6217d57d44af927d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e42a62dc492cfd9a27aa5da7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5719006c4f5016ec5b4a7544a3249efaa6d612f3c5b88f2a1a336cc5d86bb68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62af48e14adfee82be010adf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "手法真是干脆利落……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40797b76ffc1195480c99fdcea1a57eaaf37adb4a69bfb78711481c5fe31421e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:113382ef25d69b3b58e8a80a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不愧是您。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eca62168466582c56acc098522883add937ea1e06e7e09d02ee952fbefa9522a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c826cada11e9200709317b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还有下次。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc2e8d76f0d7dd3cb554708d169229f62db07191c520add563dff72d6466bbe4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "140005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb0d498f43956b3cae6f9044",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "手法真是干脆利落……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40797b76ffc1195480c99fdcea1a57eaaf37adb4a69bfb78711481c5fe31421e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "140006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:676ca6f9754438e73a1a0228",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不愧是您。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eca62168466582c56acc098522883add937ea1e06e7e09d02ee952fbefa9522a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "140007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a9088beffa9f2f5d3bb73cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "758a23ba3b4ff252a4e5eac29e32085c8aaa84f0e672e96ad91d5390fb0aa06e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "140008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b072866b29b97d6adea5260a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8af85ce981d9ec89ad4d75b1bd062ebe03e9f22dc5edb7cd9b8099f05574c6c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "140009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33101b108caf5c5eb03f26fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8718a774e82bf0d0567f91b1ad1c262e88c616da40600ba104bed8a79cabc36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59e14d6ac775d316e5227067",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "精彩绝伦……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "61f5e04319be2b6162574e9ae1d8af5d23082ce1f3702fe2d9368f0683bbbd46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a3ceac1a6c6475edbdd53f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e8a3096875a7dc77cda646ff87c9c22eca06f70f59a036288e698b17b9b7c1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22e2e2ab6ab6943912fe54b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好厉害……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6bb5498226b3d866f26cf0a04d9c2d87ff7eaab73c7dfea7fad2f870ec5d839",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84ef2f1addce7c8f2ba64c33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好可惜……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81bbfcadc7b096bbec7263c4a502fbc683ad38cf63c74a3d2877521f6a468700",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2bfd76900721f3dc085de20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "041ba8b8603a00b4e44cd331a21ab7fd8b9ea6dc6184c6a547b16419da56322f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa000d230a94d059abc9adb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您累了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d80c2bfd6b88b713c4bdac9ca2c3b2558534ab046bad2819fcc47066402b341f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1927ffc08275d493783a4f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed046546d61c8ed6ca5dc48cfde01c6ebc8c0c1ff70fc6023f97a3fb46e99390",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fde98a578b0c33408deb15c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还远远不够……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33c7eab92f283d939f62a56010cf5fc36ef3fc4b6b887b298b54ff4512dd4fe6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c6702ac4721960707e723c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天也会在这里……\r\n恭候您的光临。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27f850358cd6e34ffe477e7410e85702a9b4af38221f7c5b6847cfbdd04e3765",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69ca3558ac4c75ae60543cff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来还是体力不足啊……\r\n真是颜面扫地。\r\n休息一下应该很快就能恢复。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b00ac0c7401d0205ecee502fbed39637ca670f5ff9570a1919cdd270e17fed99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ca3782cedb24ce63d318b92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要暂时休息一下？\r\n虽然不想落后于中央……\r\n但切记不可勉强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2851372552e6db74c13d55c7db6eef37494606eef0b58b08b18399c1f96ced5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49c097a18cfa61de4af5a8b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "船桥最强，现在的我就是最强的！\n无论多么严苛的训练菜单，\n都不是我的对手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebe22268373b075bda58530b9d6c474b411677fb7051a701cbda2616474d0c74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:891a97f536168b7663a45147",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "船桥的未来一片光明——\r\n我会拿出能让您如此确信的成果。\r\n是的，一定！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3be61822844426a82244ea4587b08ef372efc9529cad510ce4314214abe8f2b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbb71670db8dd71b5f2dd39c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不必客气。\r\n为了达成故乡的夙愿，\r\n请对我进行严酷的锻炼吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f74b41bdc18da72f814c31afe125dba3fef329da56f5ebfe909391215af51b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f5374b23ded76e56bab50f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每日锻练，每日迈进。\r\n毕竟唯有积累努力，才能为船桥\r\n带来荣耀……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3d9acedb6331fbed5f96e2e57e70a7d3738b5002c10940fcd02cc57c2edb15e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0306fb339ad79bfa4d9f213",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "终点已经明确。\r\n那么剩下的唯有前行了。\r\n出发……向着船桥的未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bac8514e1a0ca4584d399048f9396f6e47b4e7a2c4159be93a0344bc050326a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c574862b2d72b91c33e56a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和中央的孩子一起热身什么的……\n我明明没打算和她们搞好关系。\n……下次一定要拒绝。一定拒绝掉……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c1463bd0b039d482b66323804d23babe9217f97af8ed9099e9b24f61091426a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c6f6fd415c4aaf30dbe3386",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……集中，集中精神。\r\n为了故乡，\r\n必须做出成果……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0ed57e3f6ebb711704edca84ed7be119187bd014425faf9b50f3ba75403bed7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a85f7526edc71d10c00eb45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我只要做该做的事就好。\r\n……仅此而已。\r\n不要去想多余的事……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96336ba68efc0c10df1af4d2401023f3052205e083d885b1ef348d795e40fc8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e722fba8b6fbc82766be152",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就在我止步不前的时候，\r\n与中央的差距正在不断拉大……。\r\n可是……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa689b6e7b07ba7b9badb36fba40f7e4ac86571be26508b863bc42278a7019d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6140fd6f8acbd0cb2daed48f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……好想触摸一下，船桥的沙子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4570098bd7f96e889eb8dcf93761e21aa0dd0c3cbb7630422bccd319440d507b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:275b4a48304da8145ee738e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不认为胡乱参加比赛会是\r\n良策。中央，并没有那么好对付。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3de547cdf4464c61587456f8e9c695800dce2cf3b7995e44891e82845ea27ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a95aba3b8e8a8b5a62d39785",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果为船桥的未来着想，现在\r\n应该重整旗鼓。……盲目增加参赛次数，\r\n无异于愚策。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9888bcff151f9c2563a6d989815a09a29585e0097b1673e3b38e3ece360d637",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e14afd5e60045246734fd651",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的我，已经没有无法战胜的敌人。\r\n问鼎最强宝座的，将会是船桥！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dfa12b1d07d73c475a864bd801d32d210f8e42de47936b544ac32f4cfbcf4d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "20023"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
